Description:

Notifications sent to a stream notifysocket are now JSON: each is one line
holding a JSON object, and an EVENT or IMIP notification carries its
message as a nested JSON object rather than a string.  The dlist stream
format is gone.  The vnd.cmu.envelope event parameter has been removed.


Documentation:

imapd.conf(5), notifysocket and event_extra_params; the "Transport" section
of the event notifications page.


Config changes:

notifysocket accepts a "json:" prefix to select the JSON stream format,
which replaces the "dlist:" prefix.

event_extra_params no longer accepts vnd.cmu.envelope.


Upgrade instructions:

Before upgrading, change a "dlist:" notifysocket to "json:", and update the
listener on that socket to read and reply with JSON lines.

Remove vnd.cmu.envelope from event_extra_params: a configuration that still
lists it will fail to parse.  Consumers that used it can fetch the message
instead, or use vnd.fastmail.jmapEmail.


GitHub issue:

None.
